From f409279db1958b840cf042df1979039fd0ebcf0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lars Grahmann <lars.grahmann@googlemail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:25:45 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/33] synaptics_tudor: Add driver for Synaptics Tudor sensors

Opens the sensor, pairs with a fresh host key, sets up the TLS session
and can list the templates stored on the chip (Kensington VeriMark DT,
047d:00f2). Enroll, verify, identify and delete are stubs.

Only commands seen in captures of the vendor driver and known to be read
only are ever sent.
---
